@startuml sequence_bridge_init
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Window Bridge - Init and Read

actor "Playwright spec" as SPEC
participant "TileHarnessPage" as POM
participant "Browser" as BR
participant "TileHarnessComponent" as HARNESS
participant "WindowBridgeService" as BRIDGE
participant "window.__pluginHarness" as WIN

SPEC -> POM: goto('id', { mode:'review', asOf:'2026-04-29' })
POM -> BR: page.goto('/tile/id?mode=review&asOf=2026-04-29')
BR -> HARNESS: instantiate
HARNESS -> BRIDGE: reset()
BRIDGE -> WIN: write snapshot { tileId:null, mode:'live', asOf:null, http:[], chart:[] }
HARNESS -> BRIDGE: setTile('id')
HARNESS -> BRIDGE: setMode('review')
HARNESS -> BRIDGE: setAsOf('2026-04-29')
note over BRIDGE,WIN: snapshot mutated in-place; window holds the same reference
HARNESS --> BR: tile rendered
POM --> SPEC: ready

SPEC -> BR: page.evaluate(() => window.__pluginHarness)
BR -> WIN: read
WIN --> BR: { tileId:'id', mode:'review', asOf:'2026-04-29', http:[], chart:[] }
BR --> SPEC: snapshot
SPEC -> SPEC: expect(snapshot.mode).toBe('review')

@enduml
